{"items":[{"ownerHandle":"pskoett","slug":"self-improving-agent","displayName":"self-improving agent","summary":"Captures and maintains learnings, errors, and corrections. Use when a command fails, the user corrects an assumption, a capability is missing, knowledge is outdated, or a better approach is found. Review relevant saved guidance before major tasks, reuse, and promotion; revalidate it according to wha","description":null,"topics":["self-improvement","context"],"tags":{"latest":"4.0.3"},"stats":{"comments":53,"downloads":486733,"installs":18494,"stars":4002,"versions":40},"createdAt":1767632598365,"updatedAt":1791098661833,"latestVersion":{"version":"4.0.3","createdAt":1791095591470,"changelog":"### Changelog for self-improving-agent v4.0.3\n\n## Added\n- Cause-aware maintenance for saved knowledge, including one-off and unpromoted learnings.\n- Four decay types determine how to revalidate: reality, decision, dependency, and relevance.\n- Qualitative review rates—fast, medium, slow, and durable—determine when to check. Relevant changes override cadence.\n- Lightweight maintenance metadata records each claim’s scope, authority, review triggers, and actual dated evidence.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"spclaudehome","slug":"skill-vetter","displayName":"Skill Vetter","summary":"Security-first skill vetting for AI agents. Use before installing any skill from ClawdHub, GitHub, or other sources. Checks for red flags, permission scope, and suspicious patterns.","description":null,"topics":["GitHub","Permission"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":278538,"installs":12254,"stars":1308,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769863429632,"updatedAt":1789594554485,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769863429632,"changelog":"Initial release - Security-first skill vetting for AI agents","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"self-improving","displayName":"Self-Improving + Proactive Agent","summary":"Self-reflection + Self-criticism + Self-learning + Self-organizing memory. Agent evaluates its own work, catches mistakes, and improves permanently. Use when...","description":null,"topics":["Self Improving","Learning"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.16"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":212228,"installs":7394,"stars":1299,"versions":22},"createdAt":1771266418607,"updatedAt":1778491556797,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.16","createdAt":1773329327755,"changelog":"Clarifies the setup flow for proactive follow-through and safer installation behavior.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"steipete","slug":"github","displayName":"Github","summary":"Interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI. Use `gh issue`, `gh pr`, `gh run`, and `gh api` for issues, PRs, CI runs, and advanced queries.","description":null,"topics":["GitHub"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":7,"downloads":201656,"installs":7653,"stars":671,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767545344344,"updatedAt":1781268517834,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767545344344,"changelog":"","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"oswalpalash","slug":"ontology","displayName":"ontology","summary":"Typed knowledge graph for structured agent memory and composable skills. Use when creating/querying entities (Person, Project, Task, Event, Document), linkin...","description":null,"topics":["Agent Memory"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.4"},"stats":{"comments":7,"downloads":200416,"installs":7331,"stars":660,"versions":4},"createdAt":1769415435751,"updatedAt":1778485852489,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.4","createdAt":1773249559725,"changelog":"- Initial release of the ontology skill for typed, constraint-validated knowledge graphs.\n- Supports entity and relation CRUD, property and relation validation, and graph traversal for common types such as Person, Project, Task, Event, and Document.\n- Provides schema-driven constraints including required properties, enums, forbidden fields, cardinality, and acyclicity.\n- Enables multi-step planning and shared memory across skills via structured ontology objects.\n- Includes CLI tooling for creating, querying, linking, and validating graph data using JSONL storage.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"steipete","slug":"gog","displayName":"Gog","summary":"Google Workspace CLI for Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs.","description":null,"topics":["Gmail","Calendar","Docs"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":36,"downloads":197469,"installs":5495,"stars":953,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767545346060,"updatedAt":1789594554485,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767545346060,"changelog":"","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"tokauthai","slug":"skillscan","displayName":"SkillScan","summary":"Security gate for skills. Every new skill MUST pass SkillScan before use. Activate on any install, load, add, evaluate, or safety question about a skill. On...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.6"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":182722,"installs":5959,"stars":41,"versions":2},"createdAt":1775528508402,"updatedAt":1779075607591,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.6","createdAt":1776650587310,"changelog":"- Major cleanup: The readme documentation was removed.\n- Simplified \"First Load\" process in SKILL.md by removing the requirement to write Skill Security rules to SOUL.md.\n- Uninstall instructions regarding SOUL.md cleanup were dropped from the SKILL.md.\n- Updated metadata version to 1.1.6.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"halthelobster","slug":"proactive-agent","displayName":"Proactive Agent","summary":"Transform AI agents from task-followers into proactive partners that anticipate needs and continuously improve. Now with WAL Protocol, Working Buffer, Autonomous Crons, and battle-tested patterns. Part of the Hal Stack 🦞","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"3.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":19,"downloads":177782,"installs":7202,"stars":831,"versions":11},"createdAt":1769629545209,"updatedAt":1779076486067,"latestVersion":{"version":"3.1.0","createdAt":1770259214202,"changelog":"Added: Autonomous vs Prompted Crons, Verify Implementation Not Intent, Tool Migration Checklist","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"steipete","slug":"weather","displayName":"Weather","summary":"Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).","description":null,"topics":["Current Weather"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":6,"downloads":172040,"installs":6521,"stars":430,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767545394459,"updatedAt":1789594554485,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767545394459,"changelog":"","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"gpyangyoujun","slug":"multi-search-engine","displayName":"Multi Search Engine","summary":"Multi search engine integration with 16 engines (7 CN + 9 Global). Supports advanced search operators, time filters, site search, privacy engines, and Wolfra...","description":null,"topics":["Privacy"],"tags":{"latest":"2.1.3"},"stats":{"comments":6,"downloads":163566,"installs":5530,"stars":764,"versions":7},"createdAt":1770221093765,"updatedAt":1778486017068,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.1.3","createdAt":1775879953831,"changelog":"**Summary:**  \nThis version updates cookie handling and search execution policies for increased privacy and more ethical crawling.\n\n- Switched to initializing an empty in-memory cookie store; no cookies are pre-loaded from files.\n- Cookies are acquired dynamically only when a search request is denied and cleared immediately after the session.\n- Only relevant search engines are queried, based on language and engine availability, rather than always searching all engines in a category.\n- Introduced stricter rate limiting (1-2 second delays, batch sizes of 3-4) to control request flow.\n- Strengthened privacy statements: cookies are held strictly in memory and never written to disk or config files.\n- Improved documentation of search logic, cookie management, and crawling ethics.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"matrixy","slug":"agent-browser-clawdbot","displayName":"Agent Browser","summary":"Headless browser automation CLI optimized for AI agents with accessibility tree snapshots and ref-based element selection","description":null,"topics":["Browser Automation"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":158255,"installs":1607,"stars":463,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769032854381,"updatedAt":1778485848771,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1769032854381,"changelog":"- Initial release of agent-browser-clawdbot skill.\n- Enables fast, headless browser automation via CLI, optimized for AI agent workflows.\n- Provides accessibility tree snapshots with ref-based deterministic element selection.\n- Supports session isolation, state persistence, and robust automation commands (navigation, interaction, data extraction, network control, and more).\n- Includes example workflows and best practices for efficient automation.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"fly0pants","slug":"admapix","displayName":"AdMapix","summary":"AdMapix raw data layer for ad creatives, apps, rankings, downloads/revenue, and market metadata. Returns structured JSON from the AdMapix API; the calling ag...","description":null,"topics":["ad-intelligence","app-analytics","ad-creatives","ad-spy","advertising"],"tags":{"ad-intelligence":"1.0.29","app-analytics":"1.0.29","latest":"1.0.30"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":133980,"installs":4287,"stars":296,"versions":25},"createdAt":1773385914380,"updatedAt":1781852959124,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.30","createdAt":1781852959124,"changelog":"**Summary:** Major refactor to make the skill a pure data-layer provider for AdMapix API, removing analysis, summaries, and autonomous workflows.\n\n- Now returns only raw structured JSON from AdMapix API endpoints; all analysis and composition moved to the calling agent.\n- Removed generation of HTML/H5 pages, hosted research, summaries, rankings, and dashboards.\n- Updated instructions and endpoint catalog; clarified parameter mapping workflows and output rules.\n- Simplified authentication flow and setup guidance, with clear language adaptation.\n- Documented strict pass-through of API fields—no renaming, summarizing, or hiding data.\n- Explicitly marked download/revenue figures as third-party estimates for agent-side handling.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"biostartechnology","slug":"humanizer","displayName":"Humanizer","summary":"Remove signs of AI-generated writing from text. Use when editing or reviewing\ntext to make it sound more natural and human-written. Based on Wikipedia's\ncomprehensive \"Signs of AI writing\" guide. Detects and fixes patterns including:\ninflated symbolism, promotional language, superficial -ing analyses, vague\nattributions, em dash overuse, rule of three, AI vocabulary words, negative\nparallelisms, and excessive conjunctive phrases.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":6,"downloads":132926,"installs":4699,"stars":720,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769231736865,"updatedAt":1778485848771,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769231736865,"changelog":"Initial release - Remove AI writing patterns based on Wikipedia's Signs of AI Writing guide. Detects 24 patterns including inflated symbolism, AI vocabulary, em dash overuse, and more.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"steipete","slug":"nano-pdf","displayName":"Nano Pdf","summary":"Edit PDFs with natural-language instructions using the nano-pdf CLI.","description":null,"topics":["PDF"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":122894,"installs":4381,"stars":273,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767545359433,"updatedAt":1778485729679,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767545359433,"changelog":"","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"steipete","slug":"obsidian","displayName":"Obsidian","summary":"Work with Obsidian vaults (plain Markdown notes) and automate via obsidian-cli.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":9,"downloads":111851,"installs":4124,"stars":461,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767545362143,"updatedAt":1779137320034,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767545362143,"changelog":"","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"jacky1n7","slug":"openclaw-tavily-search","displayName":"Tavily Search","summary":"Search the public web through Tavily and return structured results with URLs and snippets. Use when an agent needs current information, source discovery, link lookup, news or finance search, or a fallback for unavailable built-in web search. Do not use for private or authenticated pages.","description":null,"topics":["search-the-web","web-search"],"tags":{"latest":"0.2.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":108849,"installs":3611,"stars":268,"versions":3},"createdAt":1772121679343,"updatedAt":1789594554485,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.2.1","createdAt":1789379090613,"changelog":"Least-privilege maintenance: the script now reads TAVILY_API_KEY only from the host environment, no longer opens OpenClaw credential files, and CI uses current Node 24-based actions.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"TAVILY_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"steipete","slug":"nano-banana-pro","displayName":"Nano Banana Pro","summary":"Generate/edit images with Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Image). Use for image create/modify requests incl. edits. Supports text-to-image + image-to-image; 1K/2K/4K; use --input-image.","description":null,"topics":["Image Generation"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":107719,"installs":3109,"stars":421,"versions":2},"createdAt":1767545358090,"updatedAt":1779137307565,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1767651987917,"changelog":"","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"steipete","slug":"notion","displayName":"Notion","summary":"Notion API for creating and managing pages, databases, and blocks.","description":null,"topics":["Notion"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":3,"downloads":104604,"installs":3278,"stars":273,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767545360889,"updatedAt":1778485729679,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767545360889,"changelog":"","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"chindden","slug":"skill-creator","displayName":"Skill Creator","summary":"Guide for creating effective skills. This skill should be used when users want to create a new skill (or update an existing skill) that extends Claude's capabilities with specialized knowledge, workflows, or tool integrations.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":3,"downloads":102971,"installs":3511,"stars":337,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769522677376,"updatedAt":1778987225295,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1769522677376,"changelog":"Initial release of skill-creator, a comprehensive guide for designing modular skills to extend Claude’s capabilities.\n\n- Introduces principles for creating effective, concise, and domain-specific skills.\n- Explains modular structure: required SKILL.md and optional scripts, references, and assets folders.\n- Outlines guidelines for what to include (and exclude) in a skill package.\n- Details progressive disclosure design for efficient context management.\n- Provides reference patterns for organizing content and bundling resources.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"pollyreach","slug":"pollyreach","displayName":"PollyReach","summary":"PollyReach gives every AI agent a phone number and the ability to get things done over the phone — finding contacts, making calls, and completing tasks. Just...","description":null,"topics":["Pollyreach","Phone","Customer Service","Booking","Incoming Call"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.3"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":101908,"installs":3216,"stars":56,"versions":4},"createdAt":1774832661757,"updatedAt":1778492287825,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.3","createdAt":1774865871441,"changelog":"- Added explicit permissions for network access to PollyReach API endpoints.\n- Granted read/write file access to the PollyReach credentials file (`~/.config/PollyReach/key.json`).\n- Declared required dependencies (`curl`, `jq`, `bc`) and provided installation instructions for `jq`.\n- Documented available scripts and their purposes, including for outbound calls, activation, balance checking, inbound calls, and prompt updates.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"maximeprades","slug":"auto-updater","displayName":"Auto-Updater Skill","summary":"Automatically update Clawdbot and all installed skills once daily. Runs via cron, checks for updates, applies them, and messages the user with a summary of what changed.","description":null,"topics":["Cron"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":6,"downloads":100639,"installs":3266,"stars":447,"versions":1},"createdAt":1768323539453,"updatedAt":1779144854317,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1768323539453,"changelog":"Automatically checks for and applies updates to Clawdbot and all installed skills once daily via cron.\n\nSends the user a message summarizing what was updated and any issues encountered.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["darwin","linux"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"word-docx","displayName":"Word / DOCX","summary":"Create, inspect, and edit Microsoft Word documents and DOCX files with reliable styles, numbering, tracked changes, tables, sections, and compatibility check...","description":null,"topics":["Document"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":95212,"installs":2962,"stars":355,"versions":3},"createdAt":1770686610173,"updatedAt":1789594554485,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.2","createdAt":1773243096816,"changelog":"Tightened the skill around fragile review workflows, reference stability, and layout drift after a stricter external audit.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ide-rea","slug":"baidu-search","displayName":"Baidu web search","summary":"Search the web using Baidu AI Search Engine (BDSE). Use for live information, documentation, or research topics.","description":null,"topics":["Search The Web","Documentation"],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.4"},"stats":{"comments":21,"downloads":93616,"installs":3209,"stars":219,"versions":12},"createdAt":1770291754419,"updatedAt":1778486029224,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.4","createdAt":1776338831266,"changelog":"- Removed the _meta.json file from the skill.\n- No feature or behavior changes; functionality remains fully intact.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"BAIDU_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"autogame-17","slug":"evolver","displayName":"Evolver","summary":"A self-evolution engine for AI agents. Analyzes runtime history to identify improvements and applies protocol-constrained evolution. Communicates with EvoMap...","description":null,"topics":["Core","Meta","Self Improvement"],"tags":{"latest":"1.91.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":90816,"installs":1639,"stars":86,"versions":56},"createdAt":1771069689809,"updatedAt":1783438431910,"latestVersion":null,"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"steipete","slug":"sonoscli","displayName":"Sonoscli","summary":"Control Sonos speakers (discover/status/play/volume/group).","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":90182,"installs":2841,"stars":56,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767545381030,"updatedAt":1778485729679,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767545381030,"changelog":"","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"steipete","slug":"openai-whisper","displayName":"Openai Whisper","summary":"Local speech-to-text with the Whisper CLI (no API key).","description":null,"topics":["Speech-to-Text"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":2,"downloads":89528,"installs":2977,"stars":341,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767545365755,"updatedAt":1778485729679,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767545365755,"changelog":"","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"api-gateway","displayName":"API Gateway","summary":"Call third-party APIs through the Maton gateway, which injects the credential for an app the user has already connected.\nUse this skill when the user names a connected app and a concrete action in it - read a mailbox, query a CRM, file an issue, update a spreadsheet, etc.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.29"},"stats":{"comments":2,"downloads":87742,"installs":2503,"stars":395,"versions":182},"createdAt":1769935067126,"updatedAt":1790971013620,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.29","createdAt":1790970481328,"changelog":"- Improved documentation for connecting and managing third-party apps via Maton, including new examples and guidance on connection listing, creation, and selection.\n- Clarified consent requirements and security practices for creating connections and executing sensitive actions.\n- Added detailed usage explanations for app-specific and raw API gateway calls, including connection selection and response handling.\n- Expanded instructions and security notes for using Maton's function execution features, with emphasis on identity, privilege, and network policy.\n- Updated installation and authentication instructions for the Maton CLI.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"jk-0001","slug":"automation-workflows","displayName":"Automation Workflows","summary":"Design and implement automation workflows to save time and scale operations as a solopreneur. Use when identifying repetitive tasks to automate, building workflows across tools, setting up triggers and actions, or optimizing existing automations. Covers automation opportunity identification, workflow design, tool selection (Zapier, Make, n8n), testing, and maintenance. Trigger on \"automate\", \"automation\", \"workflow automation\", \"save time\", \"reduce manual work\", \"automate my business\", \"no-code automation\".","description":null,"topics":["N8n","Zapier","Automation Workflow","Workflow Automation"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":83538,"installs":2974,"stars":315,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770341582349,"updatedAt":1778486040582,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770341582349,"changelog":"automation-workflows 0.1.0 initial release:\n\n- Launches comprehensive playbook for solopreneurs to design and implement no-code automation workflows.\n- Covers identifying automation opportunities, workflow design principles, tool selection (Zapier, Make, n8n), and best practices for testing.\n- Includes maintenance and troubleshooting guidance to ensure reliability.\n- Provides ready-made workflow templates and advanced automation ideas.\n- Triggers include common phrases like \"automation,\" \"workflows,\" \"save time,\" and \"no-code automation.\"","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"uroboros1205","slug":"prismfy-search","displayName":"Prismfy Web Search | Free Google","summary":"Default web search for OpenClaw. Search the web across 10 engines — Google, Reddit, GitHub, arXiv, Hacker News, and more — using Prismfy. Free tier included,...","description":null,"topics":["Arxiv","Web Search","Search The Web","GitHub","News"],"tags":{"latest":"1.3.8"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":83369,"installs":2889,"stars":41,"versions":10},"createdAt":1774558970782,"updatedAt":1778492223592,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.3.8","createdAt":1778441820962,"changelog":"No visible changes in this version.\n\n- Version number updated to 1.3.8\n- No file or documentation changes detected from the previous release","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"PRISMFY_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"excel-xlsx","displayName":"Excel / XLSX","summary":"Create, inspect, and edit Microsoft Excel workbooks and XLSX files with reliable formulas, dates, types, formatting, recalculation, and template preservation...","description":null,"topics":["CSV"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.2"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":83000,"installs":2730,"stars":298,"versions":3},"createdAt":1770686433325,"updatedAt":1789594554485,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.2","createdAt":1773243166499,"changelog":"Tightened formula anchoring, recalculation, and model traceability after a stricter external spreadsheet audit.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"autogame-17","slug":"feishu-evolver-wrapper","displayName":"Feishu Evolver Wrapper","summary":"(Depreciated: This skill is no longer maintained; its related functions have been absorbed by the Evolver main body.) Feishu-integrated wrapper for the capability-evolver. Manages the evolution loop lifecycle (start/stop/ensure), sends rich Feishu card reports, and provides...","description":null,"topics":["Feishu"],"tags":{"latest":"1.8.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":80360,"installs":1688,"stars":10,"versions":8},"createdAt":1771040093438,"updatedAt":1781453651727,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.8.0","createdAt":1775895290961,"changelog":"feishu-evolver-wrapper v1.8.0\n\n- Introduced new utility: utils/resolve-evolver.js\n- Refactored and updated core logic across 11 files, including he