ds for code quality, creativity, and visual impact in every output.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"arnarsson","slug":"git-essentials","displayName":"Git Essentials","summary":"Essential Git commands and workflows for version control, branching, and collaboration.","description":null,"topics":["Git"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":30999,"installs":956,"stars":38,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769692045864,"updatedAt":1778485868789,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769692045864,"changelog":"Initial release of git-essentials.\n\n- Provides essential Git commands for setup, version control, branching, remote operations, stashing, rebasing, tagging, submodules, and cleaning.\n- Includes common workflows for feature branches, hotfixes, and syncing forks.\n- Offers helpful aliases, practical tips, and solutions to common issues.\n- Links to official Git documentation and resources for further learning.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"jamesfincher","slug":"browserbase","displayName":"Browserbase Persist with captcha","summary":"Create and manage persistent Browserbase cloud browser sessions with authentication persistence. Use when the user needs to automate browsers, maintain logged-in sessions across interactions, scrape authenticated pages, or manage cloud browser instances. Handles session creation, context-based auth persistence, keep-alive reconnection, captcha solving, session recording, screenshots, and session cleanup.","description":null,"topics":["Browser"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":30160,"installs":54,"stars":2,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770748803191,"updatedAt":1779076812409,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770748803191,"changelog":"Browserbase Sessions Skill 2.0.0\n\n- New skill to create and manage persistent Browserbase cloud browser sessions with authentication, captcha solving, and session recording.\