ctical guidance for communication, workflow patterns, and when not to use this skill.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"market-research","displayName":"Market Research","summary":"Research markets with sizing, segmentation, competitor mapping, pricing checks, and demand validation that turn fuzzy ideas into decision-ready evidence. Use...","description":null,"topics":["Market Research"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":27306,"installs":738,"stars":99,"versions":2},"createdAt":1770923637146,"updatedAt":1778488085397,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1773253981245,"changelog":"Expanded the guidance and clarified when this skill should activate.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"dylanbaker24","slug":"memory-hygiene","displayName":"Memory Hygiene","summary":"Audit, clean, and optimize Clawdbot's vector memory (LanceDB). Use when memory is bloated with junk, token usage is high from irrelevant auto-recalls, or setting up memory maintenance automation.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":27073,"installs":856,"stars":20,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769621830815,"updatedAt":1778987302585,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769621830815,"changelog":"Version 1.0.0 – Initial Release\n\n- Introduces memory-hygiene for auditing, cleaning, and optimizing Clawdbot's vector memory (LanceDB).\n- Provides quick commands for memory audit, wipe, and reseed.\n- Details configuration for disabling auto-capture to prevent junk memories.\n- Lists guidelines on what types of information to store or avoid storing in memory.\n- Includes instructions for setting up monthly automated maintenance.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"thomaslwang","slug":"moltguard","displayName":"MoltGuard - Security & Antivirus & Guardrails","summary":"MoltGuard — OpenClaw security gua