iltration. Risk classification L...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":26287,"installs":801,"stars":27,"versions":1},"createdAt":1772002290468,"updatedAt":1778491636632,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1772002290468,"changelog":"Initial release of skill-vetter: protocol for securely vetting AI agent skills before installation.\n\n- Introduces structured security vetting process, including source verification, code review checklist, and permissions analysis.\n- Detects red flags such as credential theft patterns, obfuscated/minified code, data exfiltration, and risky system or network behaviors.\n- Classifies risk level as LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH, or EXTREME and produces detailed, markdown-friendly vetting reports.\n- Includes practical vetting checklists, report templates, and quick audit commands for both ClawHub and GitHub skills.\n- Strongly discourages installing unvetted or sketchy skills; emphasizes rigorous pre-installation checks.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"productivity","displayName":"Productivity","summary":"Diagnoses and repairs personal productivity: overwhelm, procrastination, scattered priorities, collapsed habits, busywork that never finishes. Use when someone is overwhelmed or behind; when they cannot start, cannot stop, or keep replanning instead of working; when everything feels urgent and the list is no longer trusted; when goals never turn into shipped work; when meetings and messages eat the day; when a habit keeps breaking; when they want a weekly review, a shutdown routine, or one trusted home for goals, projects and commitments; and when the constraint is a situation — student, manager, executive, parent, freelancer, founder, creative, remote work, ADHD, burnout, or guilt about resting. Covers capacity math, estimation, WIP limits, delegation and saying no. Not for calendar-API automation (`calendar-planner`), running the day-to-day list (`task-list`), or the narrower tools: time blocking (`time-management`), habit streaks (`habits`), deep-work rituals (`deep-work`).","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.6"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":26261,"installs":855,"stars":69,"versions":7},"createdAt":1770921856602,"updatedAt":1785146483396,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.6","createdAt":1785141051074,"changelog":"Clearer disclosure of what is stored and where","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"xthezealot","slug":"youtube-transcript","displayName":"YouTube Transcript","summary":"Fetch and summarize YouTube video transcripts. Use when asked to summarize, transcribe, or extract content from YouTube videos. Handles transcript fetching via residential IP proxy to bypass YouTube's cloud IP blocks.","description":null,"topics":["Summarize"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":26188,"installs":850,"stars":24,"versions":2},"createdAt":1769530656679,"updatedAt":1778987230683,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1769532361984,"changelog":"Initial public release","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"karatla","slug":"opencode-controller","displayName":"Opencode-controller","summary":"Control and operate Opencode via slash commands. Use this skill to manage sessions, select models, switch agents (plan/build), and coordinate coding through Opencode.","description":null,"topics":["Coding"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":25814,"installs":791,"stars":80,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769633853391,"updatedAt":1778485867301,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769633853391,"changelog":"opencode-controller 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release.\n- Enables controlling Opencode sessions and workflows via slash commands.\n- Guides users through provider selection, authentication, and session management.\n- Supports agent switching between planning and building modes.\n- Enforces step-by-step planning before any code generation.\n- Ensures all actions and choices are explicit in the output.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"jk-0001","slug":"copywriting","displayName":"Copywriting","summary":"Write persuasive copy for landing pages, emails, ads, sales pages, and marketing materials. Use when you need to write headlines, CTAs, product descriptions, ad copy, email sequences, or any text meant to drive action. Covers copywriting formulas (AIDA, PAS, FAB), headline writing, emotional triggers, objection handling in copy, and A/B testing. Trigger on \"write copy\", \"copywriting\", \"landing page copy\", \"headline\", \"write a sales page\", \"ad copy\", \"email copy\", \"persuasive writing\", \"how to write [marketing text]\".","description":null,"topics":["Marketing","Email","Sales"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":25679,"installs":850,"stars":47,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770341837629,"updatedAt":1778486040582,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770341837629,"changelog":"Initial release of the Copywriting skill — write high-converting marketing copy using proven frameworks.\n\n- Provides step-by-step guidance for landing pages, headlines, CTAs, product descriptions, ads, email sequences, and more.\n- Covers core copywriting formulas: AIDA, PAS, and FAB, with clear examples.\n- Includes techniques for emotional triggers, objection handling, and trust-building with proof.\n- Offers actionable headline formulas and CTA best practices.\n- Designed for solopreneurs, marketers, and founders looking to drive action with persuasive writing.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"robert-janssen","slug":"office-document-specialist-suite","displayName":"Office Document Specialist Suite","summary":"Advanced suite for creating, editing, and analyzing Microsoft Office documents (Word, Excel, PowerPoint). Provides specialized