cription":null,"topics":["Json"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":24862,"installs":1271,"stars":31,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767545347454,"updatedAt":1778485729679,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767545347454,"changelog":"","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"robbyczgw-cla","slug":"web-search-plus","displayName":"web-search-plus","summary":"Search the web and extract URLs with routing across Serper, Brave, Tavily, Querit, Linkup, Exa, Firecrawl, You.com, SearXNG, SerpBase, and Keenable. Returns ranked sources and page text; supports freshness filters and research across providers.","description":null,"topics":["Web Search","Auto Routing","Brave","Exa","Firecrawl"],"tags":{"latest":"5.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":24540,"installs":737,"stars":99,"versions":63},"createdAt":1768946737164,"updatedAt":1791627788511,"latestVersion":{"version":"5.0.1","createdAt":1791627293863,"changelog":"Runs the Web Search Plus 5.0.1 engine: routing by query type (Brave, Exa for docs/academic, Serper for security/shopping), faster fallback, per-URL extraction and all 5.0.1 fixes. Old flags and env vars keep working; breaking changes in CHANGELOG.md.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"whatsapp-business","displayName":"WhatsApp Business","summary":"WhatsApp Business API integration with managed OAuth. Send messages, manage templates, and handle conversations. Use this skill when users want to interact with WhatsApp Business. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn a WhatsApp Business connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs a WhatsApp Business action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with WhatsApp Business examples; they add no WhatsApp Business capability - WhatsApp Business is not an event source, a trigger cannot read WhatsApp Business data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["WhatsApp","Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.9"},"stats":{"comments":4,"downloads":24498,"installs":759,"stars":61,"versions":17},"createdAt":1770202281007,"updatedAt":1790941079849,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.9","createdAt":1790940949798,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ndcccccc","slug":"calendar","displayName":"Calendar","summary":"Calendar management and scheduling. Create events, manage meetings, and sync across calendar providers.","description":null,"topics":["Calendar Management","Sync"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":24444,"installs":740,"stars":5,"versions":1},"createdAt":1771427803561,"updatedAt":1778491574637,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771427803561,"changelog":"Initial release of the calendar skill with core scheduling features.\n\n- Create and manage events and meetings\n- Set reminders and handle recurring events\n- Sync with Google, Apple, and Outlook calendars\n- View availability and find free meeting slots","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"wscats","slug":"university-applications","displayName":"命理大师","summary":"全体系命理大师 — 八字四柱、紫微斗数、奇门遁甲、六爻、梅花易数、塔罗、星盘、 数字命理、九宫飞星风水、掌纹面相、起名命名、穿衣搭配、合婚择吉一站式解读。本地档案、可选每日推送（默认关闭）、 浏览器六爻界面与 HTML 报告。仅作文化参考，不替代医疗、法律、心理、财务、婚姻等 专业建议；遇重大决策请咨询专业人士。","description":null,"topics":["财务"],"tags":{"bazi":"1.2.1","fortune":"1.2.1","latest":"1.2.10"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":24224,"installs":771,"stars":26,"versions":25},"createdAt":1773475418437,"updatedAt":1780444802523,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.10","createdAt":1780444802523,"changelog":"Version 1.2.10\n\n- Improved documentation and workflow details in references/intake-and-routing.md.\n- Expanded and clarified numerology interpretative guidance in references/numerology-framework.md.\n- Updated scripts/daily-push.js with new logic or adjustments for scheduled push notifications.\n- General refinements for better user clarity and system maintainability.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"outlook-api","displayName":"Outlook","summary":"Microsoft Outlook API integration with managed OAuth. Read, send, and manage emails, folders, calendar events, and contacts via Microsoft Graph. Use this skill when users want to interact with Outlook. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn an Outlook connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs an Outlook action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with Outlook examples; they add no Outlook capability - Outlook is not an event source, a trigger cannot read Outlook data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Api Integration","Calendar"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.5"},"stats":{"comments":3,"downloads":24101,"installs":772,"stars":46,"versions":14},"createdAt":1770117136202,"updatedAt":1790939511262,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790939422702,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"iahmadzain","slug":"home-assistant","displayName":"Home Assistant","summary":"Control Home Assistant smart home devices, run automations, and receive webhook events. Use when controlling lights, switches, climate, scenes, scripts, or any HA entity. Supports bidirectional communication via REST API (outbound) and webhooks (inbound triggers from HA automations).","description":null,"topics":["Rest Api","Smart Home","Webhook"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":23902,"installs":688,"stars":52,"versions":1},"